    "long_instructions": "#### Ask for a small piece of code\r\n\r\n1. Pick a section of your site.\r\n2. Ask the AI for a small piece of code for it. Use the section's name in your prompt.\r\n3. In the same prompt, say if the change is to its structure, style, or behavior.\r\n4. Try it out. If it's not what you wanted, tell the AI what to fix.\r\n\r\n*Example: “Add a small piece of code to the Sign Up section that shows a thank-you message when a visitor clicks the button. This changes its behavior.”*\r\n\r\n**Check your prompt:** Does it use the section's name and say if the change is to structure, style, or behavior?",
